    <string-array name="tutorials">
        <item>Press \'l\' to lowercase text or swipe North to train suggestions.</item>
        <item>Select text and press \'d\' to instantly train the prediction model.</item>
        <item>Prediction model learns your patterns automatically as you type.</item>
        <item>Grant file access to auto-sync dictionary and history to Drive.</item>
        <item>Backspace after auto-correction to instantly revert to original word.</item>
        <item>Swipe LEFT on clipboard item to Archive; swipe RIGHT to Delete.</item>
        <item>Long-press clipboard items to Pin them permanently at the bottom.</item>
        <item>Swipe South-West on \'b\' to access clipboard history.</item>
        <item>Draw circles from corners to add vowels, capitalize, or apply Ctrl/Shift.</item>
        <item>Clockwise circle from SW corner adds \'a\' (k -> ka).</item>
        <item>Anti-clockwise circle from NE corner capitalizes (k -> K).</item>
        <item>Main Shift key has corner gestures for Ctrl, Alt, and Meta hub.</item>
        <item>Slide finger on spacebar to move cursor like a trackpad.</item>
        <item>Swipe LEFT/RIGHT on spacebar to switch languages and layouts.</item>
        <item>Swipe North-West on \'m\' to launch floating Mouse Pad trackpad.</item>
        <item>Tap to Click, Double Tap for Right Click, Drag title to move Mouse Pad.</item>
        <item>Swipe North-West on \'s\' for Search &amp; Replace with Regex support.</item>
        <item>Swipe North-West on \'h\' for Typing History and snippet recovery.</item>
        <item>Swipe South-East on Emoji key for mathematical Glyphs pane.</item>
        <item>Swipe from screen edges to access Side Panel app shortcuts.</item>
        <item>Press \'b\', \'i\', or \'u\' on selected text for Bold, Italic, or Uppercase.</item>
        <item>Press \'(\', \'[\', or \'{\' on selected text to wrap in brackets.</item>
        <item>Type a 2-digit number on selected text to change its font size.</item>
        <item>Send text to Translate (\'t\'), Keep (\'k\'), Obsidian (\'o\'), or Chrome (\'c\').</item>
        <item>Swipe UP to promote or DOWN to demote suggestion priority.</item>
        <item>Swipe corners on Urdu letters for Zer, Zabar, or Pesh diacritics.</item>
        <item>Swipe South-West on \'x\', \'c\', or \'v\' for quick Cut, Copy, Paste.</item>
        <item>Swipe South-West on \'z\' or \'y\' for quick Undo or Redo.</item>
        <item>Tap the t-shirt icon (👕) to cycle through 25+ procedural themes.</item>
        <item>Swipe SE on \'p\' for Password Manager; SW for Generator.</item>
        <item>Enable Incognito Mode to pause data learning and history recording.</item>
        <item>Back up everything (settings, dictionary, history) in Backup &amp; Restore.</item>
    </string-array>
</resources>
